## Raise Dependabot security floors and regenerate locks
================================================================================

Context: GitHub Dependabot still flagged the 0.9.2 lockfiles because
pyproject floors were declared but uv.lock / src/mcp-server/uv.lock
were stale. Remaining open alerts were Authlib 1.9.1, dnspython 2.9.0,
msgpack 1.2.3, nltk 3.10.4, plus previously pinned packages that had
never been resolved into the lock (Pillow 13, filelock 4.2.1, GitPython
3.2.1, MLflow 3.17.2, certifi 2026.10.19, FastMCP 3.4.10, etc.).
dnspython 2.9.0 requires Python >=3.11, so the MCP server runtime floor
matches the app.

Changes:

1. pyproject.toml
   Raise constraint floors for authlib, dnspython, msgpack, and nltk.
2. src/mcp-server/pyproject.toml
   Same Authlib/dnspython floors; require Python >=3.11.
3. uv.lock
   Regenerate against the Databricks PyPI proxy, then rewrite URLs to
   files.pythonhosted.org / pypi.org/simple.
4. src/mcp-server/uv.lock
   Same regeneration for the standalone MCP graph.
5. docs/development.md
   Document the current security floors and the MCP Python 3.11 floor.

Modified files:
- pyproject.toml
- src/mcp-server/pyproject.toml
- uv.lock
- src/mcp-server/uv.lock
- docs/development.md
- changelogs/v0.9.2/benoitcayladbx_2026-10-30.log

